{"version":1,"content":"<p>想找地方大擦一餐，食自助餐最好！</p><p>近日有酒店和餐廳推出全新和升級主題自助餐，既有矜貴食材，又有地區特色，無論是中西日菜系，甚至印度美食都有，想約親友聚會，又或玩完之後再去食餐好，都是大胃王之選。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;海南</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.189681+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_hash":"04f73be529011b6a795083093651e7bd6f284bfa02b1b54e96dc8124ed28db1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}